living-station-incident-radio = Engineering to Security. I found a broken light at the marked fixture. I don't know what caused it.
living-station-incident-observed = I saw a broken light at the marked fixture.
living-station-incident-reported = The Chief Engineer reported a broken light at the marked fixture.
living-station-incident-unknown = I don't remember an incident at that fixture.
living-station-incident-loading = Give me a moment to check my notes.
living-station-incident-unknown-cause = I don't know who or what broke it.
living-station-incident-no-fixture = I can't check the fixture right now.
living-station-incident-lit = The fixture is lit now.
living-station-incident-unlit = The fixture has a working bulb, but it isn't lit right now.
living-station-incident-broken = The fixture still needs a working bulb.
living-station-engineer-dialogue-busy = I have a work order underway. { $fixture }
living-station-engineer-dialogue-idle = I don't have an active work order. { $fixture }
living-station-head-security-busy = I'm investigating a reported location.
living-station-head-security-idle = I don't have an active investigation.
living-station-head-cargo-busy = I have a cargo delivery underway. Use the cargo terminal to request supplies.
living-station-head-cargo-idle = I don't have an active delivery. Use the cargo terminal to request supplies.
living-station-head-medical-busy = I have a patient to treat. You can request treatment at Medbay.
living-station-head-medical-idle = I don't have an active treatment order. You can request treatment at Medbay.
living-station-head-personnel = I can talk about personnel. Job and access changes go through the station's normal procedures.
living-station-head-science = I can talk about Research. I don't have an assigned experiment to report.
living-station-rumor-radio = Engineering to Security. I have an unconfirmed report that the marked fixture needs a new bulb.
living-station-rumor-reported = The Chief Engineer relayed an unconfirmed report that the marked fixture needs a new bulb.
living-station-rumor-working-radio = Engineering to Security. I checked the marked fixture. It has a working bulb.
living-station-rumor-failed-radio = Engineering to Security. I checked the marked fixture. It needs a working bulb.
living-station-rumor-cleared = The Chief Engineer checked the fixture and confirmed it has a working bulb.
living-station-rumor-confirmed = The Chief Engineer checked the fixture and confirmed it needs a working bulb.
living-station-rumor-cannot-check = I need to get closer to the fixture to verify that report.
living-station-rumor-none = I have no active report about the fixture.
